                                <support>
                                    <p>Two marble stele fragments with wreath-and-crescent and tekmor dedication by P. Claudios to Men Askaienos, Konya Museum. Preserved height 21 cm., preserved width 18 cm.</p>
                                    <material ref="https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/48.html">marble</material>
                                    <objectType ref="https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/189.html">fragment</objectType>
