                            </supportDesc>
                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout>
                                    <p>Stele with two antae and entablature. Wreath surrounding crescent at top of main field. Inscription on entablature and below relief. P. Claudios with his wife Maria Gaia having fulfilled his tekmor-vow dedicates to Men Askaienos.</p>
                                    <rs ref="http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1">incisa a scalpello</rs>
